Package: apm
Type: Package
Title: The Aggregated Projection Matrix Method
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brad", "Ross", email = "rossb@nber.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lihua", "Lei", email = "lihualei@stanford.edu", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Implements the Aggregated Projection Matrix (APM) method for 
    identifying and estimating average counterfactual outcomes under a low-rank 
    factor model with short panel data and general outcome missingness patterns.
